n- v4.6.dev\n- v4.5.stable.official\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable - macOS Tahoe (26.0.1) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M2 (Apple8) - Apple M2 (8 threads) - 24.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nCannot drag editor main window when another dialog (e.g. \"Quick Open\") is open.\n\nLikely related to #99642 ~#99632~, since `start_drag()` on the main window never gets called. OS-handled window operations such as minimize, fullscreen and resize work.\n\nWorkaround: disable \"Expand to Title\", which lets OS handle window title bar drag. Everything works as expected.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open empty project\n- Make sure that \"Expand to Title\" is enabled\n- Verify that main editor window can be dragged\n- Open \"Quick Open...\" or \"Settings\" dialog\n- Verify that main editor window cannot be dragged\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nDefault empty project will do","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111235/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"